-align: baseline; white-space: pre;"><p dir="ltr" role="presentation" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Elder Debbie Whyte</span></p></li></ul><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">History</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Date founded, and who, what, when, where, and why of the founding, including growth, challenges, and accomplishments (feel free to cut and paste from the website).</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(74, 69, 73); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Welcome to Calvary Tabernacle, a community of Christian believers whom the Lord has blessed and multiplied tremendously over the years. Our journey started on October 19th 1991, when we had our first service in the Golden Room at the Coliseum Motor Inn in East Meadow. One year later, with only thirteen members, we purchased our first building at 78 N. Franklin.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(74, 69, 73); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Today, the Lord has added to the church people of 23 different nationalities and diverse educational background, He has enlarged our territories beyond our borders into an international realm, and blessed us with a spirit of excellence second to none. Our properties now include a Youth Center, A Kids Center, and a Worship Center.&nbsp; We invite all to worship and fellowship with us in Hempstead where God will certainly enrich your lives.</span></p></span><span id="docs-internal-guid-64a065c5-7fff-2037-1694-e6afe57e8c0b" style="caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.847); color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.847); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><div><span style="caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.847); color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.847); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br></span></span></div>Community</span></span><br class="Apple-interchange-newline" style="caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.847); color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.847); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;"></div><div><span id="docs-internal-guid-2fff8432-7fff-450c-4b8e-1a9939b00958" style="caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.847); color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.847); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;">Black: estimated from pictures</span><br></p><br></span></div><div><span style="caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.847); white-space: pre-wrap; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Times, serif; font-size: 1em;"><b>Weekly Schedule</b> </span><br></div><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.847); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;">Sunday Worship: 10:30 am</span><br></div><div><br></div><div><font color="#000000" face="Times, serif"><span style="caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.847); white-space: pre-wrap; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;"><b>Events, Programs, Specialities</b></span></font></div><div><span id="docs-internal-guid-71e518b0-7fff-58f5-90ec-3ea8ee85db98" style="caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.847); color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.847); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;"><ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;"><li dir="ltr" aria-level="1" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;"><p dir="ltr" role="presentation" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br></span></p><p dir="ltr" role="presentation" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Handmaiden’s Women’s Group</span></p></li><li dir="ltr" aria-level="1" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;"><p dir="ltr" role="presentation" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">BLUSH (Before Leading You Seek Him): ages 26-35</span></p></li><li dir="ltr" aria-level="1" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;"><p dir="ltr" role="presentation" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">SUPREME (Sisters United in Prayer, Righteousness, Empowerment, Modesty, and Excellence): ages 36-46</span></p></li><li><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;">S.O.P. (Sisters of Purpose): ages 47-54</span><br></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Times, serif;">Ambassadors: men's group</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Times, serif;">Exodus: ages 12-18</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Times, serif;">Calvary Kids Ministry: ages 3-11</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Times, serif;">Seasoned Saint: ages 55+</span></li></ul><p dir="ltr" role="presentation" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span id="docs-internal-guid-0a8cef5a-7fff-911a-ef7a-c33c508bcde1" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.847); white-space: normal; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3);"></span></span></p></span></div><div><font color="#000000" face="Times, serif"><span style="caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.847); white-space: pre-wrap; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;"><br></span></font></div><div><span style="caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.847); color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.847); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant-li