rying to be polite to us.</p><p>[R1]:</p><p>I mean, at the food distribution, so many people say bless you or God bless you and everything. I</p><p>just say, I just see it as a thank you, you know, it's like their way of saying thank you. And I'm</p><p>like, all right, cool. I don't care.</p><p>[Int]:</p><p>Awesome. Well, so now I have your email, [R2]. You have my email, [R1]. I have your email</p><p>in the thread.</p><p>And so, yeah, hopefully, um, once I get this done, I'll share it and I'll be open to feedback. Um,</p><p>and, you know, I'm Um, thanks I look forward to keeping the dialogue going. Um, Of course,</p><p>yeah.</p><p>[R1] / [R2] :</p><p>If you have any other questions and later on, or, you know, you start a new project and you feel</p><p>like, you know, you, you can get some good, like, advice or input from me, or I'm sure even</p><p>[R2], just, you know, don't hesitate to contact us.</p><p>[Int] / [R2] / [R1]:</p><p>Yeah. so much. Don't ever hesitate when it comes to stuff like that. Okay, cool. Thank you so</p><p>much I hope you all have a great day and thank you so much You're welcome. Have a good one.</p><p>You too. Bye</p><p>&nbsp;</p>	to6gNGICQ1X1EHBDN6KQVeykKas2	34.26996183866345	-118.52071758447873	17735 1/2 Horace St, Granada Hills, CA 91344, USA	f	f	f	[]	2024-04-22 15:15:36.852	2024-04-22 15:18:26.77	2024-06-21 20:54:15.862	\N
6626819f5cc3848690279ec4	Telenovelas in the Park	<p>During Climate Justice Education Week, the grassroots organization Mujeres de la Tierra (Women of the Earth) perform their signature program, Telenovelas in the Park, at CSUN. The goal of the performances is to create an entertaining, culturally relevant way to introduce environmental concerns into diverse communities. The performance includes opportunities for audience members to brainstorm proactive ways to live sustainably with the earth. </p><p></p><img height="auto" src="https://livedreligion.s3.amazonaws.com/media-1713799444747.jpg" alt="IXLA Sustanability by Aika-89.jpg" width="4528" style="aspect-ratio: 1.5013262599469497">	to6gNGICQ1X1EHBDN6KQVeykKas2	34.269982723913515	-118.52073980574951	17735 Horace St, Granada Hills, CA 91344, USA	t	f	f	[]	2024-04-22 15:23:45.166	2024-04-22 15:26:23.585	2024-06-21 20:54:17.391	\N
