662bf4de5cc3848690279fb8	Little League Opening Day	<p>US Senator Alex Padilla, a regular Little League dad here in Southern California, was a featured speaker during Northridge City Little League's opening ceremony. This annual ritual builds collective effervescence as young players suit up and parade through the facilities to gather in the outfield of Field 5. Sacred leaders from bygone eras, such as former league champions now in high school and heading for college baseball careers, visit the young neophytes to offer inspirational words of guidance. Community elders, such as parents whose children are all grown up, advise current families to cherish their time on the fields, as it will all be over before we know it.</p><p></p><p>Play ball!</p><p></p><img height="auto" src="https://livedreligion.s3.amazonaws.com/media-1714156505799.jpg" alt="opening day 3.jpg" loading="lazy" width="4032" style="aspect-ratio: 1.33333 / 1"><img height="auto" src="https://livedreligion.s3.amazonaws.com/media-1714156505804.jpg" alt="opening day 2.jpg" loading="lazy" width="4032" style="aspect-ratio: 1.33333 / 1"><p></p><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://livedreligion.s3.amazonaws.com/media-1714156754009.mp4">Video 1</a></p>	to6gNGICQ1X1EHBDN6KQVeykKas2	\N	\N	\N	f	f	f	[]	2024-04-26 18:34:14.52	2024-04-26 18:39:26.971	2024-06-21 20:54:17.38	\N
