66455e123a48ef5557d2b71a	Temple 1 Koi Pond	<p>Koi pond and lantern in near the gate of Ryozenji (Temple 1). Small fountains keep the sound of running water audible throughout most of the courtyard area.</p><p></p><img height="auto" src="https://livedreligion.s3.amazonaws.com/media-1733106500051.jpg" alt="Image description" loading="lazy" width="858" style="aspect-ratio: 1.3333333333333333">	KHAHfSWMJ6SshJHmk81TXGOPUzI3	34.1591932	134.5025826	Tsukahana-126 Ōasachō Bandō, Naruto, Tokushima 779-0230, Japan	f	f	f	[]	2024-05-16 01:13:46.498	2024-05-16 01:14:58.555	2024-12-02 02:28:53.73	\N
