66b5938a70ac713135a76200	the Mystery of the Jesus Stencil	<p>This figure can now be commonly found in Bushwick, more concentrated on the blocks near Central Ave, which leads me to think the persons stenciling this is related to the one and only print shop that has a gigantic 12 foot- tall cross on their store front window</p><p></p><img src="https://livedreligion.s3.amazonaws.com/media-1723175604409.jpg" alt="IMG_8509.jpeg">	d2v7JCxLlFT9jkQlvayOD4Z3HAL2	40.69160068620436	-73.91407242311764	166 Cornelia St, Brooklyn, NY 11221, USA	f	f	f	[]	2024-07-01 03:41:18.511	2024-08-09 03:56:58.029	2025-03-08 11:50:12.381	\N
