66b595e6ae8382984e151251	The Faces Around Mary and Baby Jesus	<p>This can be found walking down a row of restaurants in Hasbrouck I suppose as part of the store front of a shop that sells statues.</p><p></p><img height="auto" src="https://livedreligion.s3.amazonaws.com/media-1723176364625.jpg" alt="IMG_9275.jpg" loading="lazy" width="3024" style="aspect-ratio: 0.75">	d2v7JCxLlFT9jkQlvayOD4Z3HAL2	40.6916408	-73.9140959	490a Central Ave, Brooklyn, NY 11221, USA	f	f	f	[]	2024-08-09 04:02:01.708	2024-08-09 04:07:02.052	2026-04-15 13:48:37.018	\N
66b58a9570ac713135a761ff	FDNY Jesus Saves 	<p>a sticker from the same graffiti writer who writes "Jesus Saves"</p><img height="auto" src="https://livedreligion.s3.amazonaws.com/media-1723173470267.jpg" alt="IMG_7524.jpeg" loading="lazy" width="3024" style="aspect-ratio: 0.75">	d2v7JCxLlFT9jkQlvayOD4Z3HAL2	40.6916163	-73.914081	166 Cornelia St, Brooklyn, NY 11221, USA	t	f	f	[]	2024-05-22 03:11:48.279	2024-08-09 03:18:45.213	2024-08-09 03:37:23.947	\N
