66c75f7fee271ee786d83247	Jesucriston on Windshield in Queens 	<p>Many cars place markers of religion on their windows or bumpers, some larger and more pronounced than others</p><p></p><img height="auto" src="https://livedreligion.s3.amazonaws.com/media-1724342105204.jpg" alt="IMG_9644.jpeg" loading="lazy" width="3024" style="aspect-ratio: 0.75">	d2v7JCxLlFT9jkQlvayOD4Z3HAL2	40.7282239	-73.7948516	74-0-74-98 175th St, Fresh Meadows, NY 11366, USA	t	f	f	[]	2024-08-22 15:53:12.336	2024-08-22 15:55:43.653	2026-04-15 13:48:37.049	\N
