te Historical Society of Missouri, George McCue Photograph Collection, </span><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://digital.shsmo.org/digital/collection/imc/id/50833/rec/1"><span style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt"><u>https://digital.shsmo.org/digital/collection/imc/id/50833/rec/1</u></span></a></p><p><br></p>	zHwslkIPrdaiaeuXvaSbHh0JIHt1	\N	\N	\N	f	f	f	[]	2025-05-16 01:56:46.418	2025-05-16 01:58:03.08	2025-05-16 01:58:50.245	\N
68269b1bcfd83da30865d4e0	Underground Museum Plans To Feature Cathedral Mosaics- The Cathedral Basilica of St. Louis 	<img height="auto" src="https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdJr2KndpTAamYw8PvyWCrNDQRIT1ANcJ8czmWAPi8WZXP1Uj3zAeAOEuo1PLThhItAvo78ajeMkYfpn6utVvbTopTCKE8cohmdz9aVTycti-y0kEHsaX6OCoAcanYcKOzrgvGixQ?key=3MsIV_IskFe34Z10TxtHMZmP" loading="lazy" width="277" style="aspect-ratio: 0.5935919055649241"><img height="auto" src="https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcf3pwo4nll15WCdJA38u1rGmq8yeyLaFmlSsagVvAv6wod0-1cA9A4_9SPYiy9rzs6xmUGzEW9Qpfgn7gbbPKxfVOSI52AFkqLjR1HOaRYcL-SakYgk5RUC1aPL4-VNf6zWD8lnQ?key=3MsIV_IskFe34Z10TxtHMZmP" loading="lazy" width="212" style="aspect-ratio: 0.4575242718446602"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt">This front page news article from 1990 discusses the creation of the mosaic museum in the basement of the cathedral. The process of installing the mosaics, examples of the mosaics scale, and other artifacts from the cathedral will be housed there. This museum opened up a new way to attract visitors.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt">Title: Underground Museum Plans To Feature Cathedral Mosaics</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt">Creator: Teresa Coyle&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt">Publisher: The St. Louis Review</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt">Contributor: Maura Hill&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt">Date: June 8th, 1990</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt">Type: Newspaper Article</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt">Format: Pg. 1 and Pg. 6</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt">Rights: This item is being shared by an institution as a part of Shared Collections.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt">Source: JSTOR, Catholic Research Resources Alliance, Catholic News Archive, The St. Louis Review, </span><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.jstor.org/stable/community.35619275"><span style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt"><u>https://www.jstor.org/stable/community.35619275</u></span></a></p>	zHwslkIPrdaiaeuXvaSbHh0JIHt1	\N	\N	\N	f	f	f	[]	2025-05-16 01:55:13.921	2025-05-16 01:55:39.083	2025-05-16 04:58:01.612	\N
