662bf53c496553f03ae35d66	Little League Opening Day	<p>US Senator Alex Padilla, just another Little League dad here in Southern California, offered an impromptu speech during Northridge City Little League's opening ceremony in March 2024. This annual ritual builds collective effervescence as young players suit up and parade through the facilities to gather in the outfield of Field 5. Sacred leaders from bygone eras, such as former league champions now in high school and heading for college baseball careers, visit the young neophytes to offer inspirational words of guidance. Community elders, such as parents whose children are all grown up, advise current families to cherish their time on the fields, as it will all be over before we know it.</p><p></p><p>Play ball!</p><p></p><img height="auto" src="https://livedreligion.s3.amazonaws.com/media-1714156505799.jpg" alt="opening day 3.jpg" loading="lazy" width="4032" style="aspect-ratio: 1.33333 / 1"><img height="auto" src="https://livedreligion.s3.amazonaws.com/media-1714156505804.jpg" alt="opening day 2.jpg" loading="lazy" width="4032" style="aspect-ratio: 1.33333 / 1"><p></p><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://livedreligion.s3.amazonaws.com/media-1714156754009.mp4">Video 1</a></p>	to6gNGICQ1X1EHBDN6KQVeykKas2	\N	\N	\N	f	f	f	[]	2024-04-26 18:34:14.52	2024-04-26 18:41:00.442	2024-11-22 18:49:20.275	\N
