665159c38aad2c5255e53208	Mikoshi in Brooklyn	<div>a Mikoshi is a sacred Shinto shrine.</div><div><br></div><div><span style="caret-color: rgb(32, 33, 34); color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">followers believe that it serves as the vehicle to transport a deity in&nbsp;</span><a href="https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japan" title="Japan" style="caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(22, 26, 29); text-decoration: none; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);">Japan</a><span style="caret-color: rgb(32, 33, 34); color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;while moving between main shrine and temporary shrine during a festival or when moving to a new shrine. Often, the&nbsp;</span><i style="caret-color: rgb(32, 33, 34); color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);">mikoshi</i><span style="caret-color: rgb(32, 33, 34); color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;resembles a miniature building, with pillars, walls, a roof, a&nbsp;</span><a href="https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Veranda" title="Veranda" style="caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(22, 26, 29); text-decoration: none; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);">veranda</a><span style="caret-color: rgb(32, 33, 34); color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;and a railing. (wiki)</span><br></div><div><span style="caret-color: rgb(32, 33, 34); color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div><span style="caret-color: rgb(32, 33, 34); color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div><img src="https://livedreligion.s3.amazonaws.com/media-1716607405448.jpg" style="\n      max-width: 50%;\n      height: auto; /* Maintain aspect ratio */\n      /* Additional CSS properties for sizing */\n    ">&nbsp;<br><br></div>	d2v7JCxLlFT9jkQlvayOD4Z3HAL2	40.69161089699702	-73.91410959239754	166 Cornelia St, Brooklyn, NY 11221, USA	f	f	f	[]	2024-05-25 03:21:59.222	2024-05-25 03:23:47.558	2024-06-21 20:55:45.637	\N
